{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015EEtmqJfAtUPf6Pwg6ezSw","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 48\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 接受 35% sparsity 下 MLP-only pruning，不强制 attention 配额\\\\n  rationale: 全局统一排序下 attention GQA groups importance 普遍高于 MLP groups，35% sparsity\\\\n    自然只剪 MLP（367 groups）。这是模型结构特征的正确反映，不应人为干预。MLP-level correlation (N=367) 足以验证 CKA→recoverability\\\\n    假设。50% sparsity 放 Phase 2 获取 attention-level 数据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: 终止无效 GRPO，改用 SFT warmup → GRPO 两阶段恢复策略\\\\n  rationale: 35% 结构化剪枝后两个模型 accuracy 仅 0.15%（输出退化），GRPO 150 步 loss=0/grad_norm=0，无学习信号。frac_reward_zero_std\\\\n    ≈ 1.0 表明几乎所有 completion 得 0 reward，GRPO 无法计算有效 advantage。SFT warmup 用 ground truth\\\\n    数据先恢复基本能力再转 GRPO 是解决 reward desert 的标准做法。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2\\\\n    role: motivating_failure\\\\n    result: GRPO 150 步 loss=0, grad_norm=0; post-prune accuracy 0.15% for both models\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: 暂缓 SFT warmup，优先审计剪枝实现正确性\\\\n  rationale: 两个不同剪枝策略产出精确相同的 accuracy（2/1319）统计上极不寻常，35% structured pruning 不应导致 7B\\\\n    模型完全崩溃。Reviewer 怀疑存在实现 bug（config 不匹配、全零层等）。若根因是代码问题，SFT warmup 是在错误基础上浪费算力。需先排除实现问题再决定恢复策略。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2\\\\n    role: audit_target\\\\n    result: both pruned models 0.15% accuracy, identical 2/1319\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修复 min_keep_mlp=4 导致的 per-layer 过度剪枝，重跑 MVP pipeline v3\\\\n  rationale: 根因确认：min_keep_mlp=4 允许单层 MLP 被剪至 14.3% capacity，全局排序集中破坏 early layers（0-6），两个模型均崩溃至\\\\n    0.15%。修复方案：min_keep_mlp 提升到 40% per layer + per-layer capacity floor。RASP scoring\\\\n    逻辑本身正常（产生了不同剪枝结构），核心假设仍可验证，只需收紧约束后重跑。同时补基线评估。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2\\\\n    role: root_cause_identified\\\\n    result: min_keep_mlp=4 causes early layer collapse to 14.3% MLP capacity\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: 放弃 35% sparsity 作为 MVP 目标，改用 20%/25% 双 sparsity 快速探测后选优跑 GRPO\\\\n  rationale: v3 证实 35% structured pruning 对 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 太激进（Standard\\\\n    0%, RASP 1%），即使 per-layer capacity floor ≥40% 也无法挽救。蒸馏模型冗余已被压缩，比 base 模型更脆弱。RASP\\\\n    hypothesis 未被 falsify——只是当前 sparsity 下无法测试恢复性。策略：先在 20%/25% 快速 prune+eval（~1h），选\\\\n    post-prune accuracy 最合适的 sparsity 集中投入 GRPO（~15h），避免浪费 GPU 在错误 sparsity 上。35%+SFT\\\\n    warmup 留待 Phase 2。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v3\\\\n    role: negative_result\\\\n    result: Standard 0% / RASP 1% at 33% actual sparsity, per-layer floor working\\\\n      correctly\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 20% sparsity 下 RASP 29% vs Standard 1%，Scenario B 确认，GRPO 双 GPU 并行恢复对比\\\\n  rationale: RASP 20% post-prune accuracy 29% vs Standard 20% 仅 1%（p<0.0001），MLP 总容量完全相同（74.5%），差异纯粹在剪枝分布。CKA\\\\n    overlap scoring 保护了 layer 16-22 推理关键层。落入 Scenario B（最强叙事）：RASP 不仅预测 recoverability，pruning\\\\n    本身就保护推理能力。下一步 GRPO 双 GPU 并行（cuda:0 RASP, cuda:1 Standard），验证 recovery 差异。25% eval\\\\n    继续跑完收集 sparsity 阈值数据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: RASP_20=29% vs Standard_20=1%, p<0.0001\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill 270h GRPO runs，用 max_completion=1024 + 1 epoch + 2000 samples 重启，目标\\\\n    <10h 完成\\\\n  rationale: 当前 GRPO 配置 max_completion_length=4096 导致 173s/step、总计 270h，超过 EMNLP deadline。GSM8K\\\\n    的 R1 推理链通常 200-800 tokens，4096 严重浪费。MVP 只需证明 recovery 趋势（ρ ≥ 0.4），1 epoch + 2000\\\\n    samples 足够看到信号。Standard 模型 1% 起点大概率触发 RewardDesertCallback，本身就是\\\\\\\"不可恢复\\\\\\\"的证据。预估新配置\\\\n    ~625 steps × ~43s/step ≈ 7.5h。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20\\\\n    role: kill_and_restart\\\\n    result: running_too_slow\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20\\\\n    role: kill_and_restart\\\\n    result: running_too_slow\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: 正式更新 MVP 判定标准：从 per-group ρ ≥ 0.4 改为 model-level 显著性检验；扩大 eval 到 full GSM8K\\\\n    (1319 samples)\\\\n  rationale: 原 ρ ≥ 0.4 需要 per-head/per-group F(h) 与 recoverability 数据点（N≈92），但 v4\\\\n    实验是 model-level 对比（N=2），无法计算 Spearman ρ。Reviewer 建议改为：RASP-pruned model 在 matched\\\\n    sparsity + matched param count 下，post-prune accuracy 和/或 post-recovery accuracy\\\\n    显著优于 Standard-pruned model（p < 0.05）。post-prune 部分（29% vs 1%, p < 0.0001）已 pass。同时当前\\\\n    N=100 eval CI 太宽（±9pp），需扩到 full test set 1319 samples（CI ±2.4pp）。另：RewardDesertCallback\\\\n    在当前配置下不会提前终止（patience=500 steps = total steps），不影响实验但需修正论文叙事。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_fast\\\\n    role: recovery_test\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_fast\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\\\n    role: pruning_eval\\\\n    result: post-prune 29% vs 1%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: GRPO 1024-token 截断伪阴性：不接受 negative 结论，诊断性 eval + 准备 2048 重跑\\\\n  rationale: grpo_rasp_20_fast 和 grpo_standard_20_fast 全程 clipped_ratio=1.0，0 个 completion\\\\n    自然终止。DeepSeek-R1 的 think 推理链在 sampling (temp=0.7) 下远长于 greedy，剪枝后模型更冗长。1024 tokens\\\\n    不足以产出完整答案，导致 reward=0、grad_norm=0，GRPO 无学习信号。这是配置问题不是方法问题。需先做诊断性 eval（1024 tokens\\\\n    + temp=0.7）确认截断假说，再用 max_completion=2048 重跑 GRPO。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_fast\\\\n    role: recovery_test\\\\n    result: inconclusive (truncation artifact)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_fast\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: inconclusive (truncation artifact)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: 审批 Option A：max_completion_length=4096 重跑 GRPO 双实验，其余参数不变\\\\n  rationale: RASP 模型 post-prune 29% accuracy 证明它能解题，1024 截断是唯一阻碍。Option A 最快验证（~7h），失败再追加\\\\n    SFT warmup（Option B）。不需要同时调 lr/epochs 增加变量。2 GPU 空闲中，立即启动。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_fast\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: inconclusive (truncation)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_fast\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: inconclusive (truncation)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D011: Kill standard GRPO 4096 (10步零梯度), 将GPU1转给RASP GRPO 4096立即启动'\\\\n  rationale: 'grpo_standard_20_4096 前10步: clipped_ratio=0.9938, grad_norm=0, completion_length=4089/4096,\\\\n    输出为重复数字无结构。Standard pruning 20%已摧毁模型生成连贯文本能力, GRPO无法恢复, 增加token长度无济于事。10步证据充分(与D009\\\\n    1024截断不同, 这次是能力丧失)。Kill后GPU1立即启动RASP GRPO 4096, 比等GPU0 baseline eval完成提前~2h。Standard\\\\n    10步数据保留为负对照证据。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_4096\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 10步零梯度, clipped_ratio=0.99, 模型不可恢复\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_4096\\\\n    role: next\\\\n    result: pending - MVP关键实验\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D011: Kill grpo_standard_20_4096 early, start grpo_rasp_20_4096 on GPU1\\\\n    immediately'\\\\n  rationale: 10步数据确认Standard-pruned模型（1% accuracy）在4096 tokens下仍完全退化：clipped_ratio=0.9938,\\\\n    grad_norm=0, 输出为重复数字串。这不是截断问题而是模型本质退化，继续跑490步（~23h）不改变结论。Kill后释放GPU1立即启动RASP GRPO，比原计划（等GPU0\\\\n    baseline eval完成）提前~2h。Standard的失败本身是强力负对照：证明Standard pruning摧毁了GRPO恢复的前提条件。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_4096\\\\n    role: negative_control\\\\n    result: 'confirmed unrecoverable at step 10: clipped_ratio=0.9938, grad_norm=0'\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_4096\\\\n    role: mvp_critical\\\\n    result: pending launch on GPU1\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D012: RASP GRPO 4096也零梯度, 根因是sampling下无EOS而非token长度. Kill后转SFT warmup→GRPO两阶段恢复'\\\\n  rationale: 'RASP模型greedy 29%但sampling(temp=0.7)下clipped_ratio=1.0/grad_norm=0/zero\\\\n    EOS. 剪枝破坏了概率分布导致sampling下无法收敛到EOS. GRPO依赖自主生成, 对严重剪枝模型先天不适用. SFT用teacher forcing可修复终止行为,\\\\n    然后GRPO在SFT基础上优化推理. 双GPU并行: RASP SFT + Standard SFT对照. SFT~2-3h, 比继续浪费24h GPU跑零梯度GRPO合理得多.\\\\n    Standard SFT预期仍然困难(1% accuracy残留能力极低), 将作为负对照.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_4096\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 10步零梯度, clipped_ratio=1.0, sampling下无EOS\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_4096\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: D011确认不可恢复\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:35 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D014: MVP PASS — 接受 post-prune 29% vs 1% 作为充分证据，GRPO recovery 降为 Phase\\\\n    2'\\\\n  rationale: D008 MVP claim 允许 \\\\\\\"post-prune 和/或 post-recovery accuracy 显著优于 Standard\\\\\\\"。Post-prune\\\\n    RASP 29% vs Standard 1%（p<0.0001, matched params/sparsity）远超 p<0.05 门槛。GRPO 4096\\\\n    双模型均 100% 截断零梯度（D013），根因是 DeepSeek-R1 sampling+temp=0.7 推理链无 EOS，非假设失败。继续追加 token\\\\n    长度风险高且时间成本大（48h+）。SFT warmup→GRPO 作为 Phase 2 第一个实验继续推进，为 story 增色但不阻塞 MVP。EMNLP\\\\n    DDL 11 天，必须立即进入 research 阶段。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_4096\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative (truncation, but confirms RASP 5x reward vs Standard)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_4096\\\\n    role: negative_control\\\\n    result: negative (killed D011)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_fast\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: inconclusive (D009 truncation)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_20_fast\\\\n    role: negative_control\\\\n    result: inconclusive (D009 truncation)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: RASP 29% vs Standard 1% post-prune\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 00:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: SFT 结果 Standard>RASP 不改变方向，立即启动 GRPO Stage 2 作为决定性实验\\\\n  rationale: SFT Standard 64% > RASP 57% 看似威胁核心假设，但：(1) SFT 是 Stage 1 warmup 不是核心测试；(2)\\\\n    Claim 3 本来就预测 SFT 和 GRPO 对剪枝策略的偏好不同——SFT 偏好 Standard 反而是 Claim 3 的证据；(3) 真正的决定性实验是\\\\n    GRPO Stage 2。如果 GRPO 也显示 Standard ≥ RASP 则需要 pivot，但在此之前不改变方向。两卡空闲，紧急启动 GRPO Stage\\\\n    2。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sft_rasp_20\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 57% accuracy on 100 samples\\\\n  - exp_id: sft_standard_20\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 64% accuracy on 100 samples, exceeds RASP\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D016: Dream dream_20260514T233950 分析完成。Best=4/6, Median=3/6, Worst=3/6。5\\\\n    个确认行动项 + 3 个观察项。加入 plan_015(α ablation P0), plan_016(inference speedup P1), plan_017(unstructured\\\\n    baseline P1)，扩展 plan_006 到 5 seeds。'\\\\n  rationale: 三档一致的结构性问题：α ablation(Critical×3)、single model、no inference speedup、multi-seed不足、scope\\\\n    overclaim。两档一致：missing related work(FANG/FuncNet)、CKA justification、unstructured\\\\n    baseline、per-layer floor confound。数据依赖项(RASP vs GRASPrune ranking、CKA predictivity)等\\\\n    GRPO 结果决定。Dream best case 可达 Weak Accept，但需要上述修补。不降级 venue 目标。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20\\\\n    role: core\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20\\\\n    role: core\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 03:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D017: Kill GRPO Stage 2 并以优化参数重启。max_completion_length 4096→1024, max_samples\\\\n    2000→1000。当前速度 38 天完成不可行（deadline 10 天），SFT 后 EOS 已修复使缩短 completion 安全。'\\\\n  rationale: GRPO Stage 2 每 step 1h51m，500 steps 需 38 天，远超 10 天 deadline。根因是 4096\\\\n    max_completion_length 的 generation 瓶颈。SFT warmup 后 EOS rate 99%、avg completion\\\\n    176 tokens，4096 是 SFT 前的防御性设置现已不需要。1024 提供 5.8x 平均长度的 headroom。max_samples 从 2000\\\\n    降到 1000 进一步缩短训练时间，1000 prompts 对 GRPO 足够。num_generations 需 Agent 确认当前值（W&B 显示\\\\n    4，Agent 说默认 8），如已是 4 则保持。预估加速到 ~2.4 天。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: RUNNING - too slow\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: RUNNING - too slow\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 05:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D018: Reviewer 发现 Redundancy Paradox 叙事逻辑矛盾 + GQA=0 + Claim 2 scope 限定。intro\\\\n    说\\\\\\\"保留高 overlap\\\\\\\"但公式是\\\\\\\"剪掉高 overlap\\\\\\\"。20% sparsity 下仅 MLP 组被剪(0/112 attention GQA groups)，Claim\\\\n    2 scope 限定为 MLP groups。'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 深度分析发现：(1) introduction.tex L17 与 method.tex L79 矛盾——intro 称\\\\n    RASP 保留高 overlap 结构，但公式 S(h)=I(h)×(1-F)^α 明确惩罚高 F（高 overlap → 低 S → 被剪）。method.tex\\\\n    正确。(2) CKA 数据证实 MLP overlap ∈[0.879,0.997]，(1-F)^α 压缩到 Attn 的 1/5~1/50，使全局排序下\\\\n    MLP 必然被优先剪。(3) Claim 2 说 F(h) predicts recoverability，但在 20% sparsity 下只有 MLP\\\\n    groups 验证了这一点。需修正 intro + scope 限定 Claim 2 + 论文诚实交代剪枝分布。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v2\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v2\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D019: Kill GRPO v2（双组 grad_norm=0 confirmed collapse），启动 v3：max_completion_length=2048\\\\n    + format_reward + β=0.01 + gradient_checkpointing。重跑 SFT Standard（checkpoint 已删）。'\\\\n  rationale: Step 30 数据独立验证 collapse：RASP grad_norm=0 + reward 停滞 0.0125，Standard\\\\n    grad_norm=0。继续 v2 浪费 ~24h GPU。v3 三项修改针对根因（reward signal 稀疏）：2048 token 给更多生成空间，format\\\\n    reward 提供中间梯度信号，β=0.01 防漂移。gradient_checkpointing 解决 OOM 风险。sft_standard_20 被磁盘清理删除，需重训\\\\n    ~40min。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v2\\\\n    role: killed\\\\n    result: collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v2\\\\n    role: killed\\\\n    result: collapse\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 08:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: v2 全失败，合并 D019+Agent 诊断设计 v3 最终参数；拒绝 SFT-only fallback\\\\n  rationale: v2 双组 step 30 grad_norm=0 collapse，根因：(1) max_completion_length=1024\\\\n    导致 RASP 98% truncated，学习信号极弱；(2) sampling temp=0.7 下 SFT 模型退化为重复循环。v3 合并两路修复：D019\\\\n    的 2048/beta=0.01/dapo + Agent 的 temp 降低/repetition_penalty。拒绝 SFT-only story(Option\\\\n    C)——GRPO 未在公平条件下测试，结论 premature。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'negative: grad_norm=0 at step 30, 98% truncated'\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'negative: grad_norm=0 at step 30, 73-82% truncated'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 08:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D023: 核心数据可信度危机——紧急重新 eval post-prune 模型验证 29% vs 1%'\\\\n  rationale: α ablation 显示 α=0.0 (=Standard) 得到 30%，与原始 Standard 1% 矛盾 29pp。Reviewer\\\\n    假说：旧版 eval 脚本用 from_pretrained 加载剪枝模型导致权重 reinit→1% 是 artifact。如果成立，核心 claim 基础崩塌。优先级高于所有其他实验。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\\\n    role: 原始 Standard 1% 数据来源\\\\n    result: 1% 可能是 eval bug artifact\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v3\\\\n    role: 基于核心 claim 的下游实验\\\\n    result: FAILED (ref_model crash)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 09:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D025: GRPO v4 ETA 120h 不可接受，减 max_completion_length 重启 + α=4.0 边际显著需紧急验证'\\\\n  rationale: GRPO v4 每步 29min×250=120h=5天，DDL 仅 10 天。不 kill 但需优化：max_completion_length\\\\n    2048→512（SFT 平均输出 180 tokens），预计 2-4x 加速。同时探索 vLLM 可行性。α=4.0 (40%) vs α=0.0 (30%)\\\\n    边际显著 p≈0.05，如果确认则 CKA 核心贡献成立（极端加权有效），但需 N=500+ 和 512 calibration 确认。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v4\\\\n    role: 120h ETA, 需优化重启\\\\n    result: step 1/250, 29min/step\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\\\n    role: α ablation 来源\\\\n    result: α=4.0 40% vs α=0.0 30%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 10:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: α ablation Phase A 暴露 importance formula confound 风险，暂缓 framing 调整等 Phase\\\\n    B + formula 验证\\\\n  rationale: α=0.0（纯 importance 无 CKA）post-prune 30% ≈ α=2.0 的 29%，而 Standard 仅 1%。28pp\\\\n    差距可能来自 importance scoring 实现差异而非 CKA。但 post-prune 不等于 post-recovery——Phase B SFT\\\\n    结果才是 recoverability claim 的决定性证据。同时派 Agent 验证两种 mode 的 importance formula 是否相同。在两项证据到齐前不调整\\\\n    framing。α=4.0（40%）作为 backup 主结果候选。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: alpha_ablation_phase_a\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: α=0.0:30%, α=0.5:25%, α=1.0:27%, α=2.0:29%, α=4.0:40% (post-prune)\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 10:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'CRITICAL: D023 re-eval 显示 Standard post-prune ~32% 而非原始 1%，部署三路排查确定根因'\\\\n  rationale: D023 re-eval 中间结果 pruned_standard_20 准确率 32%（50/100 samples），与 α=0.0\\\\n    post-prune 30% 交叉验证一致。原始 1% 极可能是 eval bug（代码今天有更新，可能修复了 non-uniform MLP 加载）。如果确认，\\\\\\\"RASP\\\\n    29% vs Standard 1%\\\\\\\" 核心 claim 不成立。三路紧急排查：(1) eval 代码 git diff (2) westb 当前代码 re-eval\\\\n    原始模型 (3) re-eval pruned_rasp_20。暂不调整 framing，等排查结果 + Phase B SFT recovery 数据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: D023\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: re-eval pruned_standard_20 中间结果 32% vs 原始 1%\\\\n  - exp_id: alpha_ablation_phase_a\\\\n    role: cross_validation\\\\n    result: α=0.0 post-prune 30% ≈ re-eval 32%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 挂起 D006/D014 基于 \\\\\\\"29x advantage\\\\\\\" 的所有结论，等待 definitive re-eval 数据\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 确认 pruned_standard_20 原始 1% accuracy 是 eval bug（max_new_tokens=10\\\\n    截断）。Definitive re-eval 中间结果 (50/100) 显示 standard accuracy ~28%，与 α=0.0 ablation\\\\n    (30%) 交叉验证一致。原始 RASP 29% 也用了同样有 bug 的代码，真实值未知。如果 RASP re-eval 也是 ~28-30%，\\\\\\\"RASP\\\\n    29% vs Standard 1%\\\\\\\" 核心 claim 完全不成立。所有基于该 advantage 的下游决策需挂起直到两个 definitive re-eval\\\\n    (N=100, max_new_tokens=4096, greedy) 全部完成。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: D023\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: 'intermediate: standard_20 accuracy ~28% at 50/100 samples'\\\\n  - exp_id: D006\\\\n    role: suspended\\\\n    result: conclusions based on buggy eval data\\\\n  - exp_id: D014\\\\n    role: suspended\\\\n    result: conclusions based on buggy eval data\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: 将 RASP definitive re-eval 部署到 westd GPU 0 并行执行，不等 westb Standard re-eval\\\\n    完成\\\\n  rationale: westd 双卡空闲是资源浪费。数据可信度危机需要尽快拿到 RASP 和 Standard 两个 definitive re-eval 结果来判断核心\\\\n    claim 是否成立。并行跑可节省 ~1h 等待时间。同时利用 westd GPU 1 恢复 α ablation Phase B 剩余训练。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: reeval_postprune_definitive\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Standard 中间结果 28%，RASP 待跑\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: Post-prune 核心 claim 崩塌（RASP 31% vs Standard 27%, p>>0.05）。暂不 pivot，等 GRPO\\\\n    v5 决定性结果\\\\n  rationale: Definitive re-eval 证实原始 29x advantage 完全由 eval bug 造成。D006/D014/D015\\\\n    决策链数据基础失效。但 GRPO v5（step 50/250, ~5h）是唯一仍可能验证\\\\\\\"CKA-guided pruning 创造更好 recovery\\\\n    dynamics\\\\\\\"假设的实验。SFT 方向已否定（Standard 64% > RASP 57%）。Pivot 判据：|GRPO_RASP - GRPO_Standard|\\\\n    < 5pp → 全面 pivot；5-10pp → 降级 claim；>10pp → story 转为 recovery-pathway 假设。westd\\\\n    空闲卡派 GraSP baseline + α ablation 重验证，无论 pivot 与否都有价值。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: reeval_postprune_definitive\\\\n    role: definitive\\\\n    result: RASP 31% vs Standard 27%, 4pp 不显著\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v5\\\\n    role: decisive_pending\\\\n    result: step 50/250 运行中\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n  - D026\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 12:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Kill GRPO v5 (RASP+Standard)，切 v6: max_completion_length 512→1024'\\\\n  rationale: v5 训练崩溃：reward step 40 达峰 0.033 后归零，grad_norm 坍塌到 0.01，clipped_ratio\\\\n    93-97.5%。根因是 512 tokens 太短导致 R1 distill 模型无法完成推理链→无正确答案→无 reward→无梯度。Standard\\\\n    v5 参数相同会遇到同样问题。切 1024 tokens 平衡速度（~5 min/step vs v4 29 min/step）和信号质量。双卡同时起 RASP\\\\n    v6 + Standard v6 保持对照并行。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v5\\\\n    role: killed\\\\n    result: reward 归零, grad_norm 坍塞, clipped_ratio 97.5%\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v5\\\\n    role: killed_before_signal\\\\n    result: 参数相同会遇同样问题\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:46 UTC\\\\n  summary: SFT recovery 阶段 Standard 优于 RASP/α=4.0，核心假设在 SFT 层面也未得到支持\\\\n  rationale: 'Post-SFT: Standard 64% > α=4.0 62% > RASP 57%。Recovery Δ: Standard +37pp\\\\n    > RASP +26pp > α=4.0 +22pp。Standard 起点最低但恢复最多，与\\\\\\\"RASP 保留更可恢复结构\\\\\\\"叙事矛盾。Post-prune\\\\n    和 Post-SFT 两个阶段均未支持核心假设。GRPO v6 对照实验（westb 双卡运行中，ETA ~21h）是最后的验证机会——RL 训练可能展现与\\\\n    SFT 不同的 recovery dynamics。若 GRPO 也无差异，项目需根本性 pivot。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sft_alpha4_0_westd\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: Post-SFT 62%, recovery +22pp\\\\n  - exp_id: sft_standard_20_retrain\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: Post-SFT 64%, recovery +37pp\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v6\\\\n    role: decisive_pending\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v6\\\\n    role: decisive_pending\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D027\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'GRPO v6 双卡 OOM 崩溃(step 8)，切 v7: 8-bit optimizer + 100 steps 抢时间'\\\\n  rationale: v6 在 step 8 首次分配 full optimizer state 时 OOM（model+ref_model+optimizer\\\\n    > 95GB）。用户告知只剩几小时，v7 用 AdamW8bit 节省 ~50% optimizer 显存，steps 缩减到 100（~3.5h）以在时间窗口内出结果。这是决定性实验，必须在服务器到期前完成。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v6\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: OOM step 8\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v6\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: OOM step 8\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'GRPO v6 OOM at step 8, 切 v7: 8-bit AdamW optimizer + 100 steps (~3.5h)'\\\\n  rationale: v6 在 step 8 optimizer state 分配时 OOM 崩溃（max_completion_length=1024 的 KV\\\\n    cache + Adam FP32 states 超出 ~98GB VRAM）。v7 改用 AdamW8bit（bitsandbytes）减少 optimizer\\\\n    memory ~75%，steps 从 250 缩到 100——v5 在 step 40-80 已展现完整 learning/collapse 曲线，100\\\\n    steps 足以判断 RASP vs Standard 是否有差异。~3.5h 完成时间适配 deadline 压力。其余参数不变：max_completion_length=1024,\\\\n    beta=0.01, temp=0.4, rep_penalty=1.15, format_reward=0.1, gradient_checkpointing=True。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v6\\\\n    role: OOM_failure\\\\n    result: OOM at step 8\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v6\\\\n    role: OOM_failure\\\\n    result: OOM at step 8\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'GRPO v7 双组崩溃(磁盘满+静默死亡)，v8 修复: HF cache 迁移数据盘 + GPU 映射修正 + 顺序启动'\\\\n  rationale: 'v7 Standard 因 HF datasets cache 写入根分区(30GB)导致瞬时磁盘满崩溃；RASP v7 静默死亡(疑同根因)。修复:\\\\n    (1) HF_DATASETS_CACHE/HF_HOME 指向 /root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache 避免根分区写入 (2) Standard\\\\n    GPU 映射从 --gpu 1 改为 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=1 + --gpu 0 (3) 顺序启动确认稳定性。GRPO v1-v7 连续\\\\n    7 版失败均为工程问题(截断/collapse/OOM/磁盘满)而非算法问题，核心假设验证路径不变。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v7\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: silent death, no logs\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v7\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: No space left on device at dataset loading\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: α ablation SFT 差异统计不显著，GRPO v8 为唯一 pivot-or-publish 判据；GraSP 提升为 core finding\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 统计分析：N=100 下 Standard 64% vs RASP 57% p=0.31 不显著，所有 α 变体 post-SFT\\\\n    结果统计不可区分。三个核心 claim (C1/C3) 全部系于 GRPO v8 单一实验。GraSP 7% vs RASP 31% 是唯一 p<0.001\\\\n    对比，应从 baseline 提升为 core comparative finding。批准 full N=1319 eval 解决统计功效问题。framing\\\\n    调整待 GRPO v8 step 10 早期信号后决定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval-sft-alpha-0p0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 64% post-SFT\\\\n  - exp_id: eval-sft-alpha-1p0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 57% post-SFT\\\\n  - exp_id: sft_alpha4_0_westd_retry\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 62% post-SFT\\\\n  - exp_id: grasp_baseline_westd\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 7% post-prune\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: pivot_dependency\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: pivot_dependency\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: GraSP post-SFT 41% (p=0.001) 确认为论文核心 finding；α=0.5 跳过不重跑；SFT 侧 α 趋势不成立\\\\n  rationale: GraSP post-SFT 41% vs Standard 64% p=0.001，vs RASP 57% p=0.024，是唯一统计显著的\\\\n    pruning criterion 对比。α=2.0 post-SFT 62% 加入后，之前的\\\\\\\"α 越大 SFT 越差\\\\\\\"判断不再成立（62/62/64 不可区分，57%\\\\n    可能是 outlier）。α=0.5 checkpoint 损坏，但四点已足够，不值得重跑。SFT 侧任何 α 相关 claim 放弃，GraSP contrast\\\\n    提升为 core finding。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_sft_grasp_20\\\\n    role: core_finding\\\\n    result: 41% post-SFT, p=0.001 vs Standard\\\\n  - exp_id: eval-sft-alpha-2p0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 62% post-SFT\\\\n  - exp_id: eval-sft-alpha-0p5\\\\n    role: dropped\\\\n    result: CRASH - safetensors corrupted\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D035\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 17:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: GRPO v8 RASP collapse at step 20；不 kill，跑到 step 50 观察 Standard 是否也 collapse\\\\n  rationale: RASP v8 grad_norm≈0, frac_zero_std=0.9，与 v2/v5 同模式。Standard 暂时健康但 frac_zero_std\\\\n    上升中。需要区分两种情况：(a) 双方都 collapse = GRPO 对剪枝模型普遍失效（方法论贡献），(b) 只有 RASP collapse = CKA-aware\\\\n    pruning 反而损害 GRPO recovery（需 pivot）。step 50 checkpoint 是决策点。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: pivot_signal\\\\n    result: collapse at step 20\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: monitoring\\\\n    result: healthy but frac_zero_std rising\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D033\\\\n  - D034\\\\n- id: D036\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 17:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: RASP step 30 硬性 kill 门槛设定；unpruned baseline GRPO 作为最高优先级 contingency\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立确认 RASP collapse 不可逆（v2/v5/v8 三版同模式）。Step 30 kill 条件：grad_norm<0.05\\\\n    OR frac_zero_std≥0.85 OR reward<0.03。释放的 GPU 第一优先级跑 unpruned baseline GRPO——Reviewer\\\\n    指出这是 claim \\\\\\\"GRPO 对剪枝模型失效\\\\\\\"的必需证据。如果 v8 双 collapse 确认，不再出 v9，转而将 GRPO 失败作为 Claim\\\\n    3 证据（recovery pathway matters），前提是 unpruned GRPO 正常工作。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: kill_candidate\\\\n    result: collapse, step 30 kill check\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: monitoring\\\\n    result: frac_zero_std rising\\\\n  - exp_id: unpruned_baseline_grpo\\\\n    role: planned_contingency\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D035\\\\n- id: D037\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Narrative pivot: tentatively adopt \\\\\\\"Pruning for Plasticity\\\\\\\" (A), hold\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Recovery Method Conditions Pruning\\\\\\\" (B) as contingency pending Standard GRPO\\\\n    v8 result'\\\\n  rationale: RASP GRPO 3次连续 collapse (v2/v5/v8) 直接否定原核心假设 \\\\\\\"CKA-aware pruning preserves\\\\n    RLVR-recoverable structures\\\\\\\"。Narrative A 有最强的机制解释（冗余=可塑性缓冲）和新颖性，但依赖 Standard GRPO\\\\n    v8 成功。若 Standard 也 collapse → 退到 Narrative B（pruning×recovery 交互效应）。不在 Standard\\\\n    v8 完成前重写 paper_framing.md。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: collapse (grad_norm=0.011, frac_zero_std=0.90)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_v5\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_v2\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: pending_critical\\\\n    result: RUNNING step 30/100 HEALTHY\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D038\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Narrative pivot: 暂定 Narrative A (Pruning for Plasticity)，B 作 contingency，等\\\\n    Standard GRPO v8 + unpruned baseline 结果再正式改 framing'\\\\n  rationale: RASP GRPO 3次连续 collapse 否定原核心假设。Narrative A 机制解释最强（冗余=可塑性缓冲），但依赖 Standard\\\\n    GRPO 成功。若 Standard 也 collapse → fallback 到 B（recovery method × pruning strategy\\\\n    交互效应）。不提前改 paper_framing.md，避免基于未确认结果做不可逆改动。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: primary_evidence\\\\n    result: collapse (3rd consecutive)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: pending_pivotal\\\\n    result: running step 30/100 healthy\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_unpruned_baseline\\\\n    role: pending_control\\\\n    result: running step 0/100\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D039\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: Unpruned GRPO collapse invalidates \\\\\\\"pruning causes collapse\\\\\\\" premise; collapse\\\\n    ordering (RASP→Unpruned→Standard) becomes new core evidence; hold narrative commitment\\\\n    until Standard v8 completes\\\\n  rationale: Unpruned baseline GRPO 在 step 80 collapse (reward=0, frac_zero_std=1.0)，证明\\\\n    collapse 不是剪枝导致。但 collapse 顺序极其有意义：RASP (step ~10) → Unpruned (step ~80) → Standard\\\\n    (step 30+ still learning, reward 0.061+)。如果 Standard 完成 100 步不 collapse，story\\\\n    变为\\\\\\\"importance-based pruning stabilizes RLVR\\\\\\\"——比原 Narrative A 更 counterintuitive\\\\n    也更有力。Narrative A 被削弱但未完全否定（RASP 加速 collapse 的机制解释仍成立）。暂不重写 framing，等 Standard\\\\n    v8 的最终结果。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_unpruned_baseline\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: NEGATIVE - collapse at step 80, peak reward 0.044\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: pending_critical\\\\n    result: RUNNING step 30+, reward 0.061+ still rising\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: collapse at step ~10\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D037\\\\n- id: D040\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: Unpruned baseline 判定无效，需重新设计为 SFT→GRPO 流程\\\\n  rationale: grpo_unpruned_baseline 100步训练完全无效：step 10 KL=47.57（正常应<0.01），补全从 step\\\\n    1 就是乱码，frac_zero_std≥0.95。根因：未剪枝模型未经 SFT 直接进 GRPO，而 Standard/RASP 都经过了 SFT，导致不公平对比且\\\\n    ref_model 加载路径可能不一致。正确做法：SFT unpruned → GRPO unpruned，与剪枝流程对齐。优先级低于 Standard v8\\\\n    完成和 westd eval，等 GPU 空闲后安排。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_unpruned_baseline\\\\n    role: invalid_baseline\\\\n    result: KL=47.57, garbled output, training meaningless\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D041\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: Unpruned baseline 实验设计无效——缺少 SFT 步骤，不构成公平对照\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出：Standard/RASP 在 GRPO 前经过 SFT warmup，而 unpruned baseline 直接用裸模型跑\\\\n    GRPO。KL=47.57（vs Standard 的 0.003）更可能是 SFT 缺失 + 加载路径不一致所致，而非 GRPO config 问题。Agent\\\\n    的结论\\\\\\\"collapse is GRPO config issue\\\\\\\"因果推断不成立。正确做法：SFT 后的未剪枝模型做 GRPO baseline。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_unpruned_baseline\\\\n    role: invalid baseline\\\\n    result: failed (disk full + design flaw)\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D042\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: 暂不引用 GRPO collapse 因果结论——等 Standard v8 完成后对比三者 collapse timeline 再定性\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 collapse onset 差异巨大：RASP step~10 最早 collapse，Unpruned step~80，Standard\\\\n    step 40+ 仍健康（frac_zero_std=0.525 且下降）。如果 Standard v8 跑完不 collapse，正确结论变为\\\\\\\"剪枝方法显著影响\\\\n    GRPO 稳定性\\\\\\\"，这比\\\\\\\"GRPO config issue\\\\\\\"更有论文价值。同时 RASP 跨服务器 10pp 差异可能与 calibration 样本数（256\\\\n    vs 512）有关，plan_014（CKA reliability analysis）优先级应提升。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_unpruned_baseline\\\\n    role: reference - collapse at step 80\\\\n    result: failed (disk full)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: reference - collapse at step ~10\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_v8\\\\n    role: pending - step 40+ healthy, ETA step 100 ~10:30 UTC\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D041\\\\n- id: D043\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: Standard v8 step 60 确认 collapse。三模型全 collapse 时间线：RASP(10) < Standard(60)\\\\n    < Unpruned(80)。N=1319 SFT eval 无显著差异（p=0.248）。原始 RASP 优势假设不成立，需 pivot narrative。\\\\n  rationale: '1) SFT recovery: RASP 61.5% vs Standard 59.3%，Δ=2.2pp, p=0.248 不显著——CKA-based\\\\n    pruning 在 SFT recovery 上没有统计优势。2) GRPO stability: collapse 时间线与冗余保留完美负相关——RASP\\\\n    移除最多冗余最快 collapse，Standard 次之，Unpruned 最慢。这说明 CKA-based scoring 恰好移除了 GRPO 训练所需的冗余结构。3)\\\\n    Paper pivot 方向：从\\\\\\\"RASP enables better recovery\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"pruning-trainability tradeoff\\\\\\\"——方法论贡献是分析框架，不是新\\\\n    SOTA。collapse timeline 是最强数据点。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: Standard collapse at step 60\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: RASP collapse at step ~10\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_unpruned_baseline\\\\n    role: Unpruned collapse at step ~80\\\\n    result: failed\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_sft_standard_full_westd\\\\n    role: Standard SFT 59.29%\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_sft_rasp_full_westd\\\\n    role: RASP SFT 61.49%\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D042\\\\n- id: D044\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 01:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Major narrative pivot: from \\\\\\\"RASP enables better RLVR recovery\\\\\\\" to \\\\\\\"GRPO\\\\n    fails on pruned models + collapse dynamics as diagnostic\\\\\\\"'\\\\n  rationale: 'Standard GRPO step-50 eval (N=1319) shows 58.91% accuracy vs SFT baseline\\\\n    59.29% — zero accuracy gain despite peak reward at step 40. GRPO doesn''t recover\\\\n    ANY pruned model. Original Claim 1 (RASP enables superior RLVR recovery) is falsified.\\\\n    New story: GRPO failure on pruned models is the main finding; collapse speed (RASP\\\\n    ~10, Standard ~60, Unpruned ~80) reveals redundancy-stability tradeoff; paper\\\\n    becomes diagnostic/analysis contribution.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_grpo_standard_step50_full\\\\n    role: falsified original Claim 1\\\\n    result: 58.91% post-GRPO vs 59.29% post-SFT\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: established Standard collapse at step 60\\\\n    result: peak reward step 40, collapse step 60\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v9\\\\n    role: running - will establish RASP collapse dynamics\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D045\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 04:46 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Core data complete: GRPO reward-accuracy decoupling universal, pruning\\\\n    causes collapse (severity gradient confirmed)'\\\\n  rationale: 'All three models show GRPO does not improve accuracy post-SFT (unpruned\\\\n    81.77% vs 81.27%, Standard 58.91% vs 59.29%, RASP 60.65% vs 61.49%). Pruning-specific\\\\n    effect is training collapse: RASP step ~10, Standard step ~60, Unpruned never.\\\\n    Paper narrative finalized as diagnostic/analysis contribution. Scope expansion\\\\n    to 25-30% sparsity + Qwen2.5-Math-7B planned.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_grpo_unpruned_v2_step100\\\\n    role: confirmed reward-accuracy decoupling for unpruned\\\\n    result: 81.77% vs SFT 81.27%\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_grpo_rasp_v9_step5\\\\n    role: confirmed no accuracy gain for RASP pre-collapse\\\\n    result: 60.65% vs SFT 61.49%\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_unpruned_v2\\\\n    role: confirmed pruning-specificity of collapse\\\\n    result: 100 steps stable, no collapse, reward 0.661\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D044\\\\n- id: D046\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 08:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: Qwen Math calibration=256 不重跑，论文加 footnote 说明差异\\\\n  rationale: 论文 claim 是跨模型现象存在性（collapse 是否发生 + severity gradient 是否复现），不是跨模型绝对数值对比。Calibration\\\\n    256 vs 512 导致 ~5% group selection 差异，但不影响 collapse/non-collapse 的定性判断。重跑需重新计算\\\\n    importance+CKA scores (~2h GPU) + 重新剪枝，收益不值得 DDL 压力下的时间成本。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: prune_rasp_20_qwen_math\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: sparsity 18.99%, 199 MLP groups\\\\n  - exp_id: prune_standard_20_qwen_math\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: sparsity 19.28%, 202 MLP groups\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D045\\\\n- id: D047\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 09:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: 新增 RASP-RLVR 实验：反转 CKA scoring 保护冗余结构，预防 GRPO collapse\\\\n  rationale: 用户指出纯分析贡献竞争力有限。已证明冗余移除→collapse加速的单调关系，逻辑推论反转scoring（保护冗余）应防止collapse。成本低（复用现有scores，仅改公式符号）、风险低（单调关系已建立）、收益高（论文从analysis升级为diagnosis+remedy）。用户批准\\\\\\\"要做\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v9\\\\n    role: motivation\\\\n    result: RASP removes redundancy → collapse step 10\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: motivation\\\\n    result: Standard neutral → collapse step 60\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_unpruned_v2\\\\n    role: motivation\\\\n    result: Full redundancy → no collapse\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D044\\\\n  - D045\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 33560, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01KRa8Ri7W5GdPwZNTTcdWZR","session_id":"4bc2a3bd-d50f-4f56-b18b-27b29ed56804","uuid":"7d525cf8-178e-4f8c-86df-79bd35665638","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:30:04.091Z"}
